1027
00:55:28,460 --> 00:55:30,900
所以，为了检验到底管不管用，
So, to find out if it worked,

1028
00:55:30,940 --> 00:55:34,580
我们把它交给了我们的同事，
兼御用车手。
we handed it over to our
colleague and our driver also.

1029
00:55:34,620 --> 00:55:35,740
斯提格。
The Stig.

1030
00:55:38,460 --> 00:55:41,060
克拉克森：好了，发车带起一阵胎烟，
他冲出去了。
CLARKSON: Okay, a little smoke
off the line and away he goes.

1031
00:55:41,100 --> 00:55:44,020
现在斯提格装上了硬顶，
这应该能改善空气动力学，
Now, The Stig's got the
hard top on, which should
help the aerodynamics,

1032
00:55:44,060 --> 00:55:46,060
让它在直道上跑得更快。
make it faster
on the straights.

1033
00:55:46,100 --> 00:55:48,100
现在进第一个弯了。
This is the first bend now.

1034
00:55:48,140 --> 00:55:50,060
车尾看起来甩出来了一点。
这还真挺让人意外的。
Looks like the tail's
coming out a bit.
That is surprising.

1035
00:55:53,500 --> 00:55:58,500
噢果然，放的又是金耳环乐队。
开着疯癫的荷兰车，听着癫狂的荷兰曲。
Ooh yes, of course it's Golden Earring.
Crazy Dutch music in a crazy Dutch car.

1036
00:55:58,900 --> 00:56:02,180
正接近芝加哥弯。
Coming up to Chicago.

1037
00:56:02,220 --> 00:56:06,860
看样子它又在蠢蠢欲动想转向过度了。
And it's trying to oversteer
again by the looks of things.

1038
00:56:06,900 --> 00:56:10,780
最大的疑问其实是这台世爵
过锤头弯的表现会如何。
Big question is really how
will the Spyker fare 'round
Hammerhead.

1039
00:56:10,820 --> 00:56:14,220
大力刹车时车身有点发飘，
这里才是对爱推头的车真正的终极考验。
A bit wobbly underbraking,
this is the real test of
understeery cars.

1040
00:56:14,260 --> 00:56:16,700
噢，他这一下侧滑得可够横的。
Oh, he's gone very
sideways there.

1041
00:56:16,740 --> 00:56:19,220
哎哟，侧滑得厉害啊！
Ooh, very sideways.

1042
00:56:20,760 --> 00:56:22,560
看来世爵为了彻底消除转向不足，
Seems like in their attempts
to get rid of understeer,

1043
00:56:22,600 --> 00:56:25,520
反倒搞出了侧倾过度转向。
Spyker seem to have
brought on roll oversteer.

1044
00:56:25,560 --> 00:56:27,920
不过你看，他全油门切过了Follow-through弯。
Mind you, he's flat
through Follow-through.

1045
00:56:27,960 --> 00:56:30,640
油门依然到底！
And still flat.

1046
00:56:30,680 --> 00:56:33,320
一脚没收，还剩最后两个弯了。
Not a lift,
two more corners to go.

1047
00:56:33,360 --> 00:56:35,840
前半程的成绩被甩尾耽误惨了。
Time over the first half
suffered for the oversteer.

1048
00:56:35,880 --> 00:56:37,800
最后这点距离他能追回来吗？
Can he make it
up in the last little bit?

1049
00:56:37,840 --> 00:56:41,000
进甘邦弯又有点滑，冲线成绩是……
A bit more sliding
there in Gambon,
and across the line in...

1050
00:56:41,040 --> 00:56:44,720
……1分27秒3。
...one minute 27.3.

1051
00:56:44,760 --> 00:56:47,520
那就贴在这儿了。
So that goes there.

1052
00:56:47,560 --> 00:56:49,520
梅：对一件男士吸烟装来说，这成绩不算赖。
MAY: That's not bad
for a smoking jacket.

1053
00:56:49,560 --> 00:56:52,280
不，认真的，瞧瞧，它比新款斯巴鲁翼豹还要快！
No, really, look. It's quicker
than a Subaru Impreza,
the new one.

1054
00:56:52,320 --> 00:56:55,280
-比阿斯顿·马丁DB7 GT还快！
-梅：那确实了不起。
-Quicker than DB7 GT!
-MAY: That's remarkable.

1055
00:56:55,320 --> 00:56:58,960
而且……怎么说呢，只比兰博基尼盖拉多慢了1.5秒。
It is, what,
1.5 seconds slower than
a Lamborghini Gallardo.

1056
00:56:59,000 --> 00:57:02,240
不过你要是换个角度看，要是放上“酷车墙”……
But then if you
look at it this way,
if this were the cool wall...

1057
00:57:02,280 --> 00:57:07,160
-我是说，它简直就是直接在别人耳朵边上炸街。
-噢，确实是。
-I mean, it would be
kind of in your ear, really.
-Oh. Yeah.

1058
00:57:07,200 --> 00:57:09,200
不过今天的赛道环节还没完呢，
That's not the end
of the track action,

1059
00:57:09,240 --> 00:57:10,880
因为早些时候，杰里米开了这辆车。
because earlier on,
Jeremy drove this.

1060
00:57:10,920 --> 00:57:13,240
当今世界上马力最大的量产车：
It's the most powerful
production car in the world.

1061
00:57:13,280 --> 00:57:15,720
梅赛德斯-奔驰 CL65。
The Mercedes CL65.

1062
00:57:15,760 --> 00:57:18,040
我们现在想知道的是，
What we want to know
now is how it will fare

1063
00:57:18,080 --> 00:57:21,200
在一场简简单单的半英里直线加速赛里，
in just a simple, straight,
half mile drag race

1064
00:57:21,240 --> 00:57:23,280
去硬碰它的两大宿敌——
against its two main rivals,

1065
00:57:23,320 --> 00:57:26,800
宾利欧陆GT和阿斯顿·马丁DB9，战果会如何？
the Bentley Continental GT
and the Aston Martin DB9.

1066
00:57:26,840 --> 00:57:29,280
大家怎么看？有人想猜一把吗？
What do we think?
Anyone got any thoughts?

1067
00:57:30,440 --> 00:57:32,400
-你觉得是DB9？
-那辆大奔。
-You think the DB9.
-The Merc.

1068
00:57:32,440 --> 00:57:34,040
-DB9。
-DB9，还有大奔。
-DB9.
-The DB9, the Merc,

1069
00:57:34,080 --> 00:57:35,840
你看，关键问题就在这儿：DB9的软肋，
you see,
this is the thing of it,
the DB9's problem,

1070
00:57:35,880 --> 00:57:38,880
在于它“区区”只有450匹马力。我是说，“区区”哦。
it's only got 450 bhp.
I mean, only.

1071
00:57:38,920 --> 00:57:41,720
呃，而奔驰和宾利马力可要狂暴得多。
Uh, whereas the Merc
and the Bentley are
a lot more powerful.

1072
00:57:41,760 --> 00:57:44,480
但它够轻啊，这台阿斯顿可是轻得吓人。
But it is light.
The Aston is very, very light.

1073
00:57:44,520 --> 00:57:46,400
还有谁？你押奔驰？
Anyone? You think the Merc.

1074
00:57:46,440 --> 00:57:48,480
行吧，我们见识过那玩意多暴躁了，有人押宾利吗？
Well, we've seen how
powerful that is,
anyone think the Bentley?

1075
00:57:48,520 --> 00:57:50,280
-你觉得……
-欧陆GT。
-You think...
-The Continental.

1076
00:57:50,320 --> 00:57:52,320
你觉得是欧陆GT？
You think the Continental GT?

1077
00:57:52,360 --> 00:57:55,600
-那车比你家大平层还沉好不好。
-它是四驱的，对。
-That weighs a bit more
than your house.
-It's four-wheel drive. Yes.

1078
00:57:55,640 --> 00:57:57,480
-但就像你说的，它是四驱。
-确实是四驱，没错。
-But it is four-wheel drive,
as you say.
-It is, yeah.

1079
00:57:57,520 --> 00:57:59,360
所以起步抓地力绝佳，不过它可是带涡轮增压的……
So it's got good
traction off the line,
but it is turbo charged,

1080
00:57:59,400 --> 00:58:02,880
-但那台大奔也是涡轮啊！
-这场有看头了，因为真的很难说谁赢。
-but then so is that!
-It's a good one, this.
'Cause it really is difficult.

1081
00:58:02,920 --> 00:58:05,280
说真的，我们当时
彻底懵了。
真是一头雾水。
Indeed, we were
completely stumped.
We really were.

1082
00:58:05,320 --> 00:58:09,880
今天早上一到这儿，
我们根本不知道
到底哪台车能赢。
This morning, we arrived here,
we had no clue which one
was going to win.

1083
00:58:11,240 --> 00:58:12,680
所以我们只能亲自跑跑看了。
So we had to go find out.

1084
00:58:13,760 --> 00:58:15,600
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINES REVVING]

1085
00:58:25,280 --> 00:58:29,960
根本不用操心什么。
老老实实坐着，
把油门踩死就行。
There's nothing to do.
We've just got to sit here,
keep your foot down.

1086
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:32,440
那台奔驰简直神了！
That Mercedes is incredible!

1087
00:58:38,840 --> 00:58:40,560
说实话，
真有点丢人现眼。
It's all a bit
embarrassing, really.

1088
00:58:42,120 --> 00:58:43,280
噢！我跑完了。
Oh! I've finished.

1089
00:58:45,640 --> 00:58:48,480
太丢人了！
我又垫底了！
That is pathetic!
I'm last again!

1090
00:58:50,640 --> 00:58:52,400
[笑] 那可真是，呃……
[LAUGHING] That is, um...

1091
00:58:54,520 --> 00:58:57,600
刚才那一下，真的是快到离谱。
That was really, really fast.

1092
00:58:57,640 --> 00:59:00,360
我跟你们讲，在我们那个视角，
跟在后面看……
I'll tell you, from where
we were, from
behind the driver...

1093
00:59:00,400 --> 00:59:02,520
看着那玩意儿甩开我们，
简直就是……
Watching that thing pull away,
it was just...

1094
00:59:02,560 --> 00:59:05,240
-它动力源源不断地狂飙！
-一开始，牵引力控制系统
-It just keeps powering away!
-There is, there's a
traction control moment

1095
00:59:05,280 --> 00:59:06,520
介入的那下，我还和你速度一样，
and I'm going the
same speed as you,

1096
00:59:06,560 --> 00:59:08,360
-等牵引力控制系统稍微调理好……
-对。
-As the traction
control kind of sorts...
-Yeah.

1097
00:59:08,400 --> 00:59:09,960
“等会儿，这动力实在太猛了”，刚给你按住，
"Hang on a minute. Lot of
power coming here,"
sorts you out,

1098
00:59:10,000 --> 00:59:12,400
接着“轰”的一声！
他就没影了！
and then it just goes, woomph!
And he's gone!

1099
00:59:12,440 --> 00:59:15,000
-我还以为我把宾利的手刹拉着呢！
-[大笑]
-I thought I'd left the
Bentley's handbrake on!
-[LAUGHING]

1100
00:59:15,040 --> 00:59:18,120
不过重点是，
我们虽然证明了它是最快的，
Thing is, though,
we've proved
it's the quickest,

1101
00:59:18,160 --> 00:59:21,120
但你真正会掏钱买哪台，詹姆斯？
but which one would
you actually buy, James?

1102
00:59:21,160 --> 00:59:22,640
-阿斯顿。
-阿斯顿。
-The Aston.
-The Aston.

1103
00:59:22,680 --> 00:59:24,520
-阿斯顿。
-阿斯顿。
-Aston.
-Aston.

1104
00:59:24,560 --> 00:59:27,440
阿斯顿！本期节目总算有了个干净利落的结局。
Aston! A nice, clear-cut
finish to the programme.

1105
00:59:27,480 --> 00:59:29,360
下周见！晚安！
See you next week! Good night!

1106
00:59:29,380 --> 00:59:34,380
